Recommends: gnome-keyring
Description: Ubuntu launchers that start Clockify timers
 Clockify Launchers creates and maintains per-user application launchers
 that start Clockify timers. Launchers appear in the GNOME application
 grid; clicking one starts or switches the current timer. Optional
 Assisted and Autopilot modes keep the launcher set aligned with recent
 Clockify activity, conservatively and restorably. The API key is stored
 only in the system keyring.
